# Permissions (MVP)

Permissions are named constants. Never scatter string literals.

Use `hasPermission(permission)` — never compare `role === "admin"` ad hoc in UI/services beyond the helper.

## Naming

```
TEAM_MEMBER_ADD
TEAM_MEMBER_REMOVE
TEAM_SETTINGS_EDIT

MATCH_CREATE
MATCH_EDIT
MATCH_CONFIRM
MATCH_POLL_OVERRIDE

TOURNAMENT_CREATE
TOURNAMENT_EDIT

POLL_VOTE
POLL_VIEW_RESULTS

PAYMENT_SUBMIT
PAYMENT_MARK_OFFLINE
SETTLEMENT_MANAGE

FUND_VIEW
FUND_EXPENSE_ADD
FUND_CONTRIBUTION_ASK

NOTIFICATION_SEND
```

## Mapping (summary)

| Permission | Admin | Player |
|------------|-------|--------|
| TEAM_MEMBER_* / SETTINGS | yes | no |
| MATCH_* / TOURNAMENT_* | yes | no |
| MATCH_POLL_OVERRIDE | yes | no |
| POLL_VOTE / VIEW | yes | yes |
| PAYMENT_SUBMIT | yes | yes |
| PAYMENT_MARK_OFFLINE / SETTLEMENT | yes | no |
| FUND_* mutate | yes | view only |
| NOTIFICATION_SEND (manual) | yes | no |

## UI

Hide actions the user cannot perform. Services must still reject forbidden calls.
